{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-conn-dot#card-zh","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-conn-dot","commit":"b13eb5c380518fbb86d3a3a9aa0d048860eb7418","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conn-dot 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的连接状态提示插件。它将状态点叠加在侧栏品牌标记的鱼形图标左上角，并保留原有标记显示。插件同时订阅运行时 WebSocket 连接恢复状态，并立即及每 30 秒向同源根路径发送 HEAD 请求，以便在连接断开或服务器停止响应时更新状态。状态点以绿、黄、红分别表示连接正常、尚未确定或断开，悬停可查看状态、最近检查时间及探测错误；提示会根据浏览器语言切换为简体中文或英文。适合希望在 DSH Web 界面快速判断服务连接状况的用户。无需 API 密钥、账户或额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-20","lib/client.js:112-129","lib/client.js:180-213"]}
{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-conn-dot#card-en","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-conn-dot","commit":"b13eb5c380518fbb86d3a3a9aa0d048860eb7418","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conn-dot adds a sidebar status dot for DSH Web. It combines the live WebSocket state with a same-origin HEAD probe every 30 seconds. Green, amber, or red indicates connected, pending, or disconnected. Hover to see the last check and probe error. Tooltips support Chinese and English.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-20","lib/client.js:112-129","lib/client.js:180-213"]}
