{"unit_id":"afterrealism__dsh-conn-dot#feature-1","repo":"afterrealism/dsh-conn-dot","commit":"b13eb5c380518fbb86d3a3a9aa0d048860eb7418","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conn-dot 的功能「连接状态点」：在侧栏品牌鱼形图标左上角显示绿、黄或红色状态点。插件订阅实时连接状态并结合探测结果更新颜色；悬停可查看状态说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:59-68","lib/client.js:135-174","lib/client.js:208-213"]}
